From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: turbinebmw <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:45:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: simple: imx681: Add colour correction matrices

Add CCMs for the Surface Pro 12 (Intel) front camera module (MSHW0740),
taken from its Windows tuning file (imx681_MSHW0740_PTL.aiqb): the base
(global) matrix of each of the file's seven illuminants, 2300 K to 6859 K.
Each illuminant block also carries 24 hue-sector matrices after the base
one; the simple IPA takes one matrix per colour temperature. In blind A/B comparisons on real scenes
these were preferred over no colour correction.

---
--- a/src/ipa/simple/data/imx681.yaml
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/imx681.yaml
@@ -9,8 +9,39 @@
   - BlackLevel:
       blackLevel: 4096
   - Awb:
-  # A color correction matrix must be measured from a controlled chart before
-  # enabling Ccm. The generic identity matrix is not a calibration.
+  # Colour correction matrices from the Windows tuning file for this module
+  # (imx681_MSHW0740_PTL.aiqb): the base (global) matrix of each of its seven
+  # illuminants (the file also carries 24 hue-sector matrices per illuminant).
+  - Ccm:
+      ccms:
+        - ct: 2300
+          ccm: [  1.645, -0.316, -0.329,
+                 -0.495,  1.718, -0.223,
+                 -0.088, -1.231,  2.319 ]
+        - ct: 2586
+          ccm: [  1.642, -0.386, -0.256,
+                 -0.437,  1.688, -0.251,
+                 -0.044, -1.037,  2.081 ]
+        - ct: 2736
+          ccm: [  1.738, -0.582, -0.156,
+                 -0.443,  1.662, -0.219,
+                 -0.018, -0.821,  1.839 ]
+        - ct: 3547
+          ccm: [  1.773, -0.666, -0.107,
+                 -0.358,  1.592, -0.234,
+                 -0.021, -0.662,  1.683 ]
+        - ct: 4701
+          ccm: [  1.663, -0.502, -0.161,
+                 -0.277,  1.563, -0.286,
+                 -0.024, -0.593,  1.617 ]
+        - ct: 5817
+          ccm: [  1.692, -0.544, -0.148,
+                 -0.252,  1.655, -0.402,
+                 -0.021, -0.601,  1.621 ]
+        - ct: 6859
+          ccm: [  1.737, -0.616, -0.121,
+                 -0.248,  1.657, -0.409,
+                 -0.018, -0.536,  1.554 ]
   - Adjust:
   - Agc:
       # Raise gain beyond 1/60 s of exposure to limit motion blur.
